Procedure
1. Save the programs as chat_server.py and chat_client.py.
2. Open two terminals in the same folder.
3. Run python chat_server.py in the first terminal.
4. Run python chat_client.py in the second terminal.
5. Exchange messages between the server and client.
6. Enter bye to end the chat.
Result
The TCP echo client–server programs using TCP and UDP sockets and a two-way TCP chat application were implemented successfully.
